{
  "voice_id": "voice-00",
  "alignment": "one-clip-one-shot-one-caption",
  "slowdown_allowed": false,
  "max_speedup_factor": 1.55,
  "shots": [
    {
      "id": "S01",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "text": "1998年夏，日本和歌山，一场社区夏祭。",
      "start": 0.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.06,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.046,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.01,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.01,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 0.03,
      "speech_end": 4.04,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "S02",
      "narration_id": "N01",
      "text": "一锅咖喱，让四个人再也没有回家。",
      "start": 5.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 3.335,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 3.333,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 3.33,
      "spoken_seconds": 3.33,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 5.0,
      "speech_end": 8.33,
      "characters": 14,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.8
    },
    {
      "id": "S03",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "7月25日，园部地区的主妇们，在车库里架起大锅。",
      "start": 10.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.47,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.435,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.37,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.37,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 10.03,
      "speech_end": 15.4,
      "characters": 21,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S04",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "切土豆、搅咖喱、说说笑笑，汗顺着额头一直往下流。",
      "start": 17.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.02,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.84,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.73,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.73,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 17.03,
      "speech_end": 22.76,
      "characters": 20,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.857
    },
    {
      "id": "S05",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "中午，孩子、老人、刚下班的邻居，排队来领饭。",
      "start": 24.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.13,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.127,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.12,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.12,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 24.0,
      "speech_end": 29.12,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
    },
    {
      "id": "S06",
      "narration_id": "N02",
      "text": "夕阳很好，蝉声很响，没有人察觉任何异常。",
      "start": 30.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.12,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.119,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.07,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.84,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0473,
      "speech_start": 30.03,
      "speech_end": 34.87,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "S07",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "没过多久，一位老人放下勺子，捂着额头说，头晕。",
      "start": 35.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.91,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.768,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.68,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.68,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 35.03,
      "speech_end": 40.71,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
    },
    {
      "id": "S08",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "紧接着，人们一个接一个蹲下，有人大喊：咖喱，停！",
      "start": 42.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.59,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.574,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.48,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.48,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 42.03,
      "speech_end": 47.51,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
    },
    {
      "id": "S09",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "救护车一辆接一辆开进窄街，红灯在墙上打转。",
      "start": 49.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.91,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.886,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.78,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.78,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 49.03,
      "speech_end": 54.81,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
    },
    {
      "id": "S10",
      "narration_id": "N03",
      "text": "医生起初以为，这只是夏天的食物中毒。",
      "start": 55.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 3.63,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 3.625,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 3.6,
      "spoken_seconds": 3.6,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 55.02,
      "speech_end": 58.62,
      "characters": 16,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "S11",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "可症状越来越重：六十七人中毒，四个人没能救回来。",
      "start": 60.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.14,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.118,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.01,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.01,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 60.03,
      "speech_end": 65.04,
      "characters": 21,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S12",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "检验结果出来了：让所有人中毒的，是砒霜，也就是砷。",
      "start": 67.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.38,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.297,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.19,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.19,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 67.03,
      "speech_end": 72.22,
      "characters": 21,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S13",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "所以这不是食物中毒，这是一次蓄意的投毒。",
      "start": 74.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.27,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.265,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.23,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.23,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 74.03,
      "speech_end": 79.26,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.0
    },
    {
      "id": "S14",
      "narration_id": "N04",
      "text": "全城震惊。警方在那口锅周围拉起警戒线。",
      "start": 80.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.085,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.08,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.06,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.87,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0398,
      "speech_start": 80.0,
      "speech_end": 84.87,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.4
    },
    {
      "id": "S15",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "警方要查清楚：谁靠近过那口锅？谁有机会一个人留下？",
      "start": 85.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.18,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.15,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.04,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.04,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 85.03,
      "speech_end": 90.07,
      "characters": 22,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.143
    },
    {
      "id": "S16",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "那天进过车库的每一个人，都被重新排查一遍。",
      "start": 92.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 3.89,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 3.8,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 3.69,
      "spoken_seconds": 3.69,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 92.03,
      "speech_end": 95.72,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.714
    },
    {
      "id": "S17",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "法院后来认定：有一位主妇，曾独自看管过一段时间。",
      "start": 99.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.49,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.489,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.42,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.42,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 99.0,
      "speech_end": 104.42,
      "characters": 21,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.5
    },
    {
      "id": "S18",
      "narration_id": "N05",
      "text": "她叫林真须美，那年37岁，就住在这条街上。",
      "start": 105.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.29,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.289,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.24,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.24,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 105.01,
      "speech_end": 109.25,
      "characters": 18,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.6
    },
    {
      "id": "S19",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "她和丈夫健治，做过保险推销和灭白蚁，都碰过砷。",
      "start": 110.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.67,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.667,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.63,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.63,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 110.03,
      "speech_end": 114.66,
      "characters": 20,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.857
    },
    {
      "id": "S20",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "警方在她家搜出一包白色粉末；检验之后，是同样的砷。",
      "start": 117.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.05,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.048,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.0,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.0,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 117.0,
      "speech_end": 122.0,
      "characters": 22,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.143
    },
    {
      "id": "S21",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "案发之前那十年，夫妻俩多次靠保险诈骗拿到钱。",
      "start": 124.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.51,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.506,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.44,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.44,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 124.0,
      "speech_end": 128.44,
      "characters": 20,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
    },
    {
      "id": "S22",
      "narration_id": "N06",
      "text": "检方说：家里的砷，和锅里的砷，成分相同。",
      "start": 130.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.06,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.038,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.93,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.79,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0304,
      "speech_start": 130.03,
      "speech_end": 134.82,
      "characters": 16,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.2
    },
    {
      "id": "S23",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "text": "记者围住她家；她举起水管朝镜头喷水，水花溅在镜片上。",
      "start": 135.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 7.23,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 7.207,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 7.14,
      "spoken_seconds": 6.88,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0473,
      "speech_start": 135.0,
      "speech_end": 141.88,
      "characters": 23,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.286
    },
    {
      "id": "S24",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "text": "这一幕传遍全国。很多人看完，心里已经先判了她。",
      "start": 142.0,
      "duration": 7.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.76,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.72,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.61,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.61,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 142.03,
      "speech_end": 147.64,
      "characters": 20,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.857
    },
    {
      "id": "S25",
      "narration_id": "N07",
      "text": "同年12月，她因这锅咖喱被捕；她说：我没有做。",
      "start": 149.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.21,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.188,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 5.14,
      "spoken_seconds": 5.14,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 149.03,
      "speech_end": 154.17,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.167
    },
    {
      "id": "S26",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "text": "2002年，和歌山地方法院，判处她死刑。",
      "start": 155.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.4,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.386,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.35,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.35,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 155.03,
      "speech_end": 159.38,
      "characters": 17,
      "target_chars_per_second": 2.833
    },
    {
      "id": "S27",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "text": "没有动机，没有直接证据；法院靠的是鉴定和证词。",
      "start": 161.0,
      "duration": 6.0,
      "source_seconds": 5.05,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 5.028,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.92,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.92,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 161.03,
      "speech_end": 165.95,
      "characters": 20,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.333
    },
    {
      "id": "S28",
      "narration_id": "N08",
      "text": "2009年，最高法院维持死刑；辩方质疑证据。",
      "start": 167.0,
      "duration": 5.0,
      "source_seconds": 4.65,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 4.636,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 4.6,
      "spoken_seconds": 4.6,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 167.03,
      "speech_end": 171.63,
      "characters": 19,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.8
    },
    {
      "id": "S29",
      "narration_id": "N09",
      "text": "她至今在狱中喊冤；第三度再审还在审理。你觉得，凶手是她吗？",
      "start": 172.0,
      "duration": 8.0,
      "source_seconds": 6.59,
      "natural_clip_seconds": 6.57,
      "natural_speech_seconds": 6.49,
      "spoken_seconds": 6.49,
      "tempo_factor": 1.0,
      "speech_start": 172.0,
      "speech_end": 178.49,
      "characters": 25,
      "target_chars_per_second": 3.125
    }
  ],
